,"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Abre el inventario de DMS y la acción de creación. Asigna un nombre reconocible, como `Acme Evaluation DMS`."},"1672":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"En **Enrollment CA**, selecciona la CA que emitió `device.crt`."},"1673":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"En **Registration Mode**, selecciona `PRE_REGISTRATION` para el recorrido que comienza con un alta explícita."},"1674":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"En la sección de autenticación, activa **Require client certificate** y deja **Call external webhook** desactivado. Bajo **Require client certificate**, añade a **Validation CAs** la CA cuyos certificados iniciales aceptarás; para esta evaluación puede ser la misma CA. Mantén habilitada **Verify CSR Signature** y deja **Enable server-side key generation** desactivado si no lo vas a utilizar."},"1675":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-61/es/platform/iot-fleets/quicks